      <version name="0.3.0" author="James" time="2026-10-27T01:44:31Z">
        <changelog>Send works per take: sends the active take you picked (send again after picking another); new 'Send all takes' sends every unsent pass, grouped. Sent status tracked per take, so re-recording into a sent item is caught. Selection check compares takes, not counts. Unique take IDs within the same second (fixes a REAPER 'files exist' freeze). Per-song comping style (lanes/takes) detected at publish; takes mode adds incoming takes to the matching item without moving existing audio.</changelog>
