      <version name="0.4.0" author="James" time="2026-10-27T02:38:51Z">
        <changelog>Live sync (replaces Take inbox): every recording goes out by itself when you stop, all passes, printed at the item's exact extent; everyone's takes are rebuilt in the same tracks, lanes and multi-take items; the host shares its existing takes and lanes. Print modes wet (default) / dry / both, with FX-free mirror tracks for wet prints. Takes reprint as new revisions when FX, volume, pan or fades change. The session driver's deletes, moves, trims, lane moves and lane/take choices propagate; 'Take control' passes driving. New Status window with two-way receipts. Fixes: 'dry' prints went through the track (now truly dry), lane play state restore, dry twins on preview upgrade, take deletes in background tabs.</changelog>
